OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry with sunny spells for most
OL,6,Fareas, though coastal showers are
OL,7,Flikely to continue to affect parts of
OL,8,FKent through the day. Windy along the
OL,9,Fcoast where it will feel chilly.
OL,10,FBreezy inland.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with showers
OL,13,Fpersisting over Kent. Variable cloud
OL,14,Fand mostly dry elsewhere though late
OL,15,Fshowers are possible over Sussex.
OL,16,FStaying breezy especially near the
OL,17,Fcoast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
