OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloudy at first with further
OL,6,Fshowers over Kent and Sussex. Turning
OL,7,Fbrighter from the east through the
OL,8,Fafternoon with all parts dry by dusk.
OL,9,FBreezy.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FHigh
OL,12,Fpressure continues to dominate in the
OL,13,Fcoming days. Cloudy but mostly dry
OL,14,Fwith some brighter spells possible
OL,15,Ffurther east. Breezy, especially near
OL,16,Fthe coast. Feeling cool.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
